# - VM 0 EPTP is 0x40401e (entry 0), VM 1 EPTP is 0x40d01e (entry 1), entry 2 is invalid (0).
# - Leaf 64 (> 63) triggers #UD before VM-Exit (exit reason 0 -> 0xe2110000).
# - Leaf 1 (disabled in VM_FUNCTION_CONTROL) reflects EXIT_REASON_VMFUNC (59 -> 0xe211003b).
# - Leaf 0 with index 512 (>= VMFUNC_EPTP_ENTRIES) reflects EXIT_REASON_VMFUNC (0xe211003b).
# - Leaf 0 with index 2 (invalid EPTP 0) reflects EXIT_REASON_VMFUNC (0xe211003b).
# - Leaf 0 with index 0 (same EPTP) is a no-op, followed by index 1 (switches VM 0 -> VM 1 EPT);
#   VM 0 has "ud2" after the switch, whereas VM 1 has "18x nop; hlt", proving EPTP switched
#   without exiting to L1 (0xe2e20001).
